<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  CBR002 Inspections Conducted (Summary), ported from legacy's JasperServer report
  (cbr-legacy jasper-server .../CBR002_InspectionsConducted.rpt_jrxml), its layout kept but for one
  fault: every value was one fixed line, so a long Road Name or Crossing Name was cut off. Each
  value now wraps, and the row's column lines grow with it. The title and summary bands, printed
  only for legacy's Excel export, are left out.

  As in the other reports, the port fills from rows rather than SQL - legacy called
  CBR_INSPCTNS_CONDUCTED_RPT with a WHERE clause built as a string - every field already formatted
  as legacy's patterns printed it. The ministry line (the CBR_HEADER subreport) is P_MINISTRY, the
  logo comes from the classpath through P_LOGO, and Date Printed is P_DATE_PRINTED, in Pacific time.
-->
